684
38:14.690 --> 38:15.500
she falls for

685
38:15.500 --> 38:16.420
someone else?

686
38:19.300 --> 38:20.430
You're ridiculous.

687
38:20.650 --> 38:21.460
Uncle,

688
38:21.710 --> 38:22.420
when you like someone,

689
38:22.420 --> 38:23.960
you shouldn't hold your feelings inside.

690
38:23.960 --> 38:25.010
You must take action.

691
38:25.010 --> 38:25.760
Take action!

692
38:30.760 --> 38:31.510
Don't you find

693
38:31.510 --> 38:33.820
yourself a bit different from before?

694
38:36.900 --> 38:38.360
Although your words

695
38:38.360 --> 38:39.900
are still a bit cold,

696
38:40.010 --> 38:41.270
there is finally a hint

697
38:41.300 --> 38:42.760
of tenderness in your eyes.

698
38:42.760 --> 38:43.360
So you're already

699
38:43.360 --> 38:44.690
different from before.

700
38:47.150 --> 38:48.860
If you have nothing better to do,

701
38:48.860 --> 38:51.050
move these to the computer room.

702
38:52.800 --> 38:53.510
No, no.

703
38:53.510 --> 38:54.610
I'm very busy.

704
38:54.690 --> 38:55.500
Well...

705
38:56.420 --> 38:57.760
Take action. Go for it.

706
38:58.710 --> 38:59.570
Do take action!

707
39:08.000 --> 39:10.280
[Have some desserts and start a day of good mood.]

708
39:36.210 --> 39:38.000
[Meeting Room]

709
39:38.160 --> 39:40.020
The Light Chaser has been tested.

710
39:40.090 --> 39:41.420
It'll be launched soon.

711
39:41.630 --> 39:42.630
The publicity department

712
39:42.630 --> 39:43.630
should finish

713
39:43.630 --> 39:45.000
the proposal in time

714
39:45.440 --> 39:46.500
for the machine's

715
39:46.500 --> 39:47.400
debut.

716
39:48.130 --> 39:49.460
We'll hold

717
39:49.460 --> 39:50.400
an open competition

718
39:50.400 --> 39:52.130
for the selection of the proposal.

719
39:52.130 --> 39:53.400
I hope you'll pool your wisdom

720
39:53.400 --> 39:55.960
together and compete in a fair, just, and open manner.

721
39:55.960 --> 39:56.860
In the end, we will pick

722
39:56.860 --> 39:58.090
the best plan.

723
39:58.550 --> 39:59.400
I hope all of you

724
39:59.400 --> 40:01.400
will actively take part in brainstorming

725
40:01.400 --> 40:02.380
and contribute

726
40:02.380 --> 40:03.240
the best ideas.

727
40:03.960 --> 40:04.760
-Sure. -Yes.

728
40:04.760 --> 40:05.590
I think you can

729
40:05.650 --> 40:07.050
all go a bit bolder.

730
40:07.050 --> 40:08.090
Since the Light Chaser

731
40:08.090 --> 40:09.260
is a brand new project,

732
40:09.260 --> 40:09.860
we can allow

733
40:09.860 --> 40:11.440
more revolutionary ideas.

734
40:12.690 --> 40:14.190
How about a city flash mob?

735
40:14.340 --> 40:16.400
It'll generate more buzz.

736
40:28.440 --> 40:33.170
I've nailed my uncle for you.

737
40:33.570 --> 40:34.130
What?

738
40:36.860 --> 40:38.000
You've got this.

739
40:38.960 --> 40:39.570
You've got this!

740
40:39.570 --> 40:40.170
Ms. Fang.

741
40:41.340 --> 40:42.400
Continue, please.

742
40:43.530 --> 40:44.480
You've got this!

743
40:46.920 --> 40:49.230
Go for it! Go, girl!

744
40:53.530 --> 40:55.330
Can't you see we're in a meeting?

745
40:55.650 --> 40:56.500
Would you stop

746
40:56.500 --> 40:58.300
wandering around and find some real business

747
40:58.300 --> 40:59.610
to do in your spare time?

748
40:59.610 --> 41:00.860
H-How am I wandering around?

749
41:00.860 --> 41:02.030
I'm here for serious business, okay?

750
41:02.030 --> 41:03.900
I'm here to return the VR glasses.

751
41:05.150 --> 41:06.860
You're too free, aren't you?

752
41:10.490 --> 41:11.690
Show our professionalism...
